WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 e47167fc1482d0b37cf8c1318d2bbbbb

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.260
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, tunapotumia kitanzi cha repeat

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.910
kuchora vitu, kila kitu kipya tunachochora

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.310
huongeza kitu kwenye picha.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.360
Tukichora tofali jipya ukutani,

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.840
limeziba pengo. Tukichora maduara kumi,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.500
tunaona maduara kumi kwenye skrini.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.220
Ni kama mchoro uliopakwa rangi. Ukipaka rangi

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.580
ukutani, haitoweka unapochora

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.440
kitu kipya pembeni yake. Inabaki

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.320
pale pale. Lakini vipi kama tunataka kufanya

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.980
kitu kionekane kinasogea? Umewahi

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.150
kuona kitabu cha kugeuza kurasa? Kilikuwa maarufu sana

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.339
nilipokuwa mtoto, lakini sasa si hivyo tena.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.640
Kitabu cha kugeuza kurasa ni kitabu kidogo ambacho kila

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.440
ukurasa wake una mchoro tofauti kidogo. Unapogeuza

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.640
kurasa hizo haraka, macho yako yanaona

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.170
michoro ikibadilika, na ubongo wako unafikiri kuna kitu

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.020
kinasogea. Kwa kweli hakuna kinachosogea. Ni picha nyingi tu

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:58.530
zilizotofautiana kidogo, moja baada ya nyingine. Na

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.400
hivyo ndivyo uhuishaji unavyofanya kazi kwenye msimbo.

00:01:02.589 --> 00:01:05.500
Hila ni ile ile. Kabla hatujachora

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.920
picha mpya, tunapaka rangi ya nyuma

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.920
juu ya turubai lote, kama vile

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.400
kuanza ukurasa mpya kwenye kitabu chetu cha kugeuza kurasa,

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.140
kisha tunafanya mabadiliko madogo

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:21.740
kwenye picha ili ionekane kuna mwendo. Kwa hivyo,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.040
tukichukua kizuizi cha msimbo tulichokizoea ambapo

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:27.520
tunachora maduara kwenye skrini,

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.820
tunaweka variable position (nafasi), na tuna

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.900
kizuizi cha repeat ambapo tunachora duara

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.640
kisha tunasogeza position moja kwenda kulia.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.110
Tukiendesha kizuizi hicho cha repeat mara 100,

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.940
tutaona maduara 100

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.320
kwenye skrini. Sasa, angalia kinachotokea

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:47.440
tukiongeza mstatili mmoja wa kawaida kabla ya kuchora

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.260
duara kila mara. Badala ya mfululizo wa

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.210
maduara, sasa macho yetu yanadanganywa kuona

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.440
duara moja linaloonekana likiteleza

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:01.000
kwenye skrini. Kila mara tunapopita kwenye kitanzi,

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.060
tunapaka rangi mpya ya nyuma kabisa, tunafunika

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.860
kila kitu kilichokuwa pale awali, kisha tunachora

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.120
duara mahali pake papya. Kila

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.540
mzunguko wa kitanzi ni kama ukurasa mpya

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.720
kwenye kitabu cha kugeuza kurasa. Na jambo la muhimu

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.570
kuelewa hapa ni kwamba hatusogezi

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:22.390
duara. Duara si object

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.250
inayoteleza kuvuka. Ni mchoro tu. Kila

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.220
mara tunapopita kwenye kitanzi, tunapaka rangi juu ya

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.350
mchoro wa zamani, na tunatengeneza mchoro mpya kabisa

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.120
kidogo upande wa kulia. Jicho lako linaunganisha

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.280
yote pamoja na kuona mwendo, lakini kwa kweli,

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.390
ni michoro mingi tofauti tu, moja baada ya nyingine.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.160
Katika zoezi linalofuata, utatumia

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.420
wazo hili kutengeneza machweo ya jua. Utasogeza

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.829
jua, utabadilisha ukubwa wake, utabadilisha

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.100
rangi yake. Yote ni mbinu ile ile. Weka

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:53.900
variables, paka rangi mpya ya nyuma, kisha chora kila kitu.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.190
Sasisha variables hizo, kisha rudia. Na

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.170
kama wewe ni mwanachama wa Premium, ukimaliza

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.750
zoezi la machweo, utafungua pia

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:05.860
mradi mgumu zaidi unaoitwa Ua Linalochipua, ambapo unaweza

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.180
kujipa changamoto kweli kwa kuunganisha

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.360
mambo haya yote pamoja. Ni mradi wa kufurahisha sana.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.240
Bahati njema, na tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
